    "en": {
      "text": "Finishing a reload after having dealt damage with the weapon grants a Stack of Splicer Surge. Maximum of 3 Stacks.\n\nSplicer Surge grants the following at 1|2|3 Stacks:\n• 10? | 20? | 45? Handling\n• 10 | 20 | 45 Reload Speed\n• 3.3% | 6.6% | 10% decreased Reload Animation Duration\n\nStowing the weapon removes the buff.",
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-11T22:42:23.000Z",
      "updatedBy": "StardustD2"
    }
  },
